        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tired Rhodes Island Operator",
        "text": "Hey. What's the situation?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_089"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Seasoned Rhodes Island Operator",
        "text": "Not too good. There's only a couple of devils left on the lower level..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Seasoned Rhodes Island Operator",
        "text": "But they're all battle-hardened mercenaries, and horrible at that. Give them a single screw, and they'd come up with a hundred ways to kill you with it."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Seasoned Rhodes Island Operator",
        "text": "In terms of combat ability, we're about even. In terms of numbers, we've only got half theirs."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_012"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tired Rhodes Island Operator",
        "text": "Uh, do you have a but? I'm gonna lose all the feeling in my legs..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_089"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Seasoned Rhodes Island Operator",
        "text": "Yeah. 'But' the mercs are having some interteam strife. At least the bunch outside are. The ones below us right now, I'm not too sure."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_012"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tired Rhodes Island Operator",
        "text": "You know that's not good news, right? Ugh, ow... that guy just now was a ruthless bastard..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_089"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Seasoned Rhodes Island Operator",
        "text": "If you've done emergency treatment, you're good. Think of something else for now, distract yourself."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_012"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tired Rhodes Island Operator",
        "text": "...It's gotten hotter and hotter up above. Ever since just now, the action up there's gotten a little scary... and, uh, well, how do I put it? Makes it a little hard to breathe."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_089"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Seasoned Rhodes Island Operator",
        "text": "I said distract yourself, not think about it all!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_012"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tired Rhodes Island Operator",
        "text": "...Amiya. Amiya's alright, isn't she? And that Lungmen officer. Uh, I only met her once... but when I think about how they're dealing with... with... uh, what was it?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_089"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Seasoned Rhodes Island Operator",
        "text": "Give it a rest, you're starting to talk in tongues. Actually, you've lost plenty of blood\u2014hold on, we've got news."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
            "volume": 0.4
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Panicked Voice",
        "text": "It's me. I'm nearly at ground level\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_089"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Seasoned Rhodes Island Operator",
        "text": "...What's the situation? The enemy?"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Panicked Voice",
        "text": "Stroke of good luck. The Arts explosion just now at the top of the tower was like a volcano erupting. Engulfed the floor we were holding. We dispatched a few sentries in all the chaos, and the rest of them had to evacuate down to open ground\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_089"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Seasoned Rhodes Island Operator",
        "text": "I thought they'd be defending this place to the death..."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Panicked Voice",
        "text": "Maybe they all had a premonition of sorts. They all know, what's going on up there is beyond any 'tactical' level of foresight now\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_sp_ballista"
        }
    },
