            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_012"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tired Rhodes Island Operator",
        "text": "F... finally\u2014!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_089"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Seasoned Rhodes Island Operator",
        "text": "Don't drop your guard, we're still\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Seasoned Rhodes Island Operator",
        "text": "\u2014\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_012"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tired Rhodes Island Operator",
        "text": "W\u2014why'd you go mute? Hello\u2014?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tired Rhodes Island Operator",
        "text": "What's so interesting about the sky? Is something going on at the tower...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tired Rhodes Island Operator",
        "text": "...Wait, i\u2014is that an... orb of light? A ball... a ball of fire? A halo? What IS that?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_088"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Steady Rhodes Island Operator",
        "text": "Arts."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_012"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tired Rhodes Island Operator",
        "text": "...Arts?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_090"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Panicked Rhodes Island Operator",
        "text": "Ah! I've been making a record. Since the start, that first huge sound, the flames and heated airstreams have burst through the building's dome. From beneath the tower, to the naked eye, it looks like..."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Like the afterglow of the setting sun."
    },
    {
        "text": "Like the death of Infected as successive as the waves."
    },
    {
        "text": "Like rage."
    },
    {
        "text": "Like this city placed in ruin."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_012"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tired Rhodes Island Operator",
        "text": "...I don't think I'm particularly perceptive compared to the rest of you, but I know more or less what you want to say here, really."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_088"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Steady Rhodes Island Operator",
        "text": "That'd be the leader of Reunion's..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_089"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Seasoned Rhodes Island Operator",
        "text": "Heat and flame."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Seasoned Rhodes Island Operator",
        "text": "But heat and flame... shouldn't be things so fearful."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_088"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Steady Rhodes Island Operator",
        "text": "Mm. That ball of light. That's one... two people's. No, perhaps even more than that, even more rage..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_089"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Seasoned Rhodes Island Operator",
        "text": "So that's... Talulah?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_088"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Steady Rhodes Island Operator",
        "text": "It isn't. Or put another way, it's not just her. Not by far. Everyone knows the leader of Reunion as the intel described her, but I can't draw a line between that young little dragon and what I'm seeing now at all..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_090"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Panicked Rhodes Island Operator",
        "text": "Just what... just what happened up there?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_089"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Seasoned Rhodes Island Operator",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_088"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Steady Rhodes Island Operator",
        "text": "...I don't know."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_090"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Panicked Rhodes Island Operator",
        "text": "Amiya..."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
